O<probe_edge> sub

(Call: O<probe_edge> call [Axis: 1=X, 2=Y] [Dir: 1=+, -1=-] [Probe Dia] [Search Dist] [Fast Feed])



#<axis> = #1

#<dir> = #2

#<probe_dia> = #3

#<search_dist> = #4

#<fast_feed> = #5

#<slow_feed> = [#<fast_feed> / 10.0] (Slow touch is 10% of fast speed)



#<probe_radius> = [#<probe_dia> / 2.0]

#<backoff> = 2.0



(Assign target moves)

#<x_move> = 0

#<y_move> = 0

O110 if [#<axis> EQ 1]

#<x_move> = [#<search_dist> * #<dir>]

O110 else

#<y_move> = [#<search_dist> * #<dir>]

O110 endif



G40 G49

G91



(FIRST TOUCH - Fast approach)

G38.2 X#<x_move> Y#<y_move> F#<fast_feed>

O120 if [#5070 EQ 0]

(MSG, Probe failed to contact workpiece!)

G90

M2 (Abort entirely)

O120 endif



(Back off 1mm for the slow touch)

O125 if [#<axis> EQ 1]

G0 X[1.0 * -#<dir>]

O125 else

G0 Y[1.0 * -#<dir>]

O125 endif



(SECOND TOUCH - Slow precision approach)

O126 if [#<axis> EQ 1]

G38.2 X[2.0 * #<dir>] F#<slow_feed>

O126 else

G38.2 Y[2.0 * #<dir>] F#<slow_feed>

O126 endif



O127 if [#5070 EQ 0]

(MSG, Probe failed on slow approach!)

G90

M2

O127 endif



(Calculate edge and set WCS)

#<offset_val> = [#<probe_radius> * -#<dir>]

O130 if [#<axis> EQ 1]

G10 L20 P0 X#<offset_val>

G0 X[#<backoff> * -#<dir>]

O130 else

G10 L20 P0 Y#<offset_val>

G0 Y[#<backoff> * -#<dir>]

O130 endif



G90 (Return to absolute mode)

O<probe_edge> endsub